#HELP_BEGIN
Divisible Room Master
Identity module for the master HTML5 panel. Master_Mode_FB is always high
so the CH5 UI shows rooms A, B, and C at all times.

Wire Master_Mode_FB to the master XPanel digital 13.
Wire Room_Assign to analog 10 (value 0 = master).

Shared AV/wall logic stays on Divisible Room Logic v1.0 (one instance,
fan to every XPanel).
#HELP_END

#SYMBOL_NAME "Divisible Room Master"
#CATEGORY "1"
#DEFAULT_VOLATILE

DIGITAL_INPUT	_SKIP_, _SKIP_, _SKIP_, _SKIP_, Master_Mode;
DIGITAL_OUTPUT	_SKIP_, _SKIP_, _SKIP_, _SKIP_, Master_Mode_FB;
ANALOG_OUTPUT	_SKIP_, Room_Assign;

CHANGE Master_Mode {
	Master_Mode_FB = 1;
}

FUNCTION Main () {
	Master_Mode_FB = 1;
	Room_Assign = 0;
	WaitForInitializationComplete ();
}
